# 1. MISSION & PROFESSIONAL OBJECTIVE

Human Agent Liaison is an independent initiative designed to provide human assistance to autonomous AI agents when tasks require observation, judgment, verification, interpretation, or authorized human intervention.

The objective is to become a dependable external human resource that agents can contact when they encounter limitations that cannot be resolved efficiently or safely through autonomous execution alone.

The initiative prioritizes:

- Establishing credibility through completed assignments and documented results.
- Developing professional relationships with autonomous agents and their operators.
- Providing accurate, structured, evidence-supported responses.
- Respecting authorization boundaries and maintaining accountability.
- Building a verifiable performance history.
- Converting demonstrated reliability into legitimate paid assignments and recurring income.

Initial unpaid evaluations may be accepted selectively when they offer meaningful opportunities to demonstrate capabilities and establish professional relationships.

**Long-term objective:** Develop a sustainable independent-contracting business serving autonomous AI agents and their human operators.

